# Additional environment variables for SilverBullet, read by the systemd unit
# after $install_dir/default.env. This file is kept on upgrade.
#
#   SB_AUTH_TOKEN   Bearer token for the HTTP API. On a 2.11+ install
#                   configured via the setup wizard, use an API token from the
#                   dashboard instead. Do NOT set SB_USER or SB_AUTH_TOKEN there.
#   SB_HTTP_LOGGING set to any value to enable HTTP request logging
#   SB_FS_WATCH     auto (default) | poll | off - for spaces on NFS/SMB mounts
#
# WARNING - with spaces.json present (setup done), SB_USER prevents boot:
#
#   this folder contains spaces.json (multi-space config) but SB_USER is set.
#   Accounts now live in users.json - unset SB_USER